<title>USA: LaserSight licenses MindSight technology.</title>
<headline>LaserSight licenses MindSight technology.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>LaserSight Inc said Thursday it reached an agreement to acquire exclusive licensing rights to neural network and other artificial intelligence information technologies developed by MindSight Inc.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>MindSight has adapted neural network technologies to various eye surgeries, including interocular lens surgery and radial keratotomy.</p>
<p>LaserSight is a holding company with businesses involved in managed vision care administration and ophthalmic practice management.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
